    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "Psst, hey. You saw Michael and Marion's bodies too, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff B",
        "text": "Dude! Don't remind me, I've been trying to <i>forget</i>! It was freaking terrifying!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff B",
        "text": "M-My hands are still shaking so much, I don't think I can hold the boom mic..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "You're still worried about work?! When there's an actual serial killer on set right now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff B",
        "text": "So... let's skedaddle?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "You want to run? Did you already forget how Michael and Marion ended up like that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "Michael even had his suitcase right under him. I heard he'd been packed and ready to go for quite a while. Even found himself a secret passage to leave through..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "And he still was murdered right before he left the plate."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "No way that killer's gonna let any of us leave."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff A",
        "text": "It's just like the plot of <i>Jack The Liberipper</i>. This set is now his hunting ground, and any one of us could very well be his prey."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
