    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Abner, how long has it been since you inspected your chest rig?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Look, there's a bunch of loose screws on your mechanical arm. One little slip, and that camera's gonna be shards of glass all over the floor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "If it breaks, it breaks."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "At least let me take a look at your camera lens then."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "I'm good."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "I'm your assistant, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "Don't think I don't see what you're actually up to\u2014you best stay away from me, kiddo."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Dalton's death was no accident, right? The same goes for Shelly, Michael, and Marion..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "There's no way the victims were chosen at random. All of them were involved in that incident five years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "focus": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "You should be working for one of those gossip rags, not behind a camera."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Who said they were mutually exclusive? Reporters make more dough though... Anyway, Abner, my good man, you were there five years ago, right? C'mon, you can tell me. Not like we'll be doing anything else today."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
