    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "Miss Rutherford, you have no lines in this scene..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Then do you suppose I could simply stay in my room researching which exact foundation shade Lady Dupont should be wearing before she dies?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "That will be decided after we finish the climatic scenes at the end, which are still... I'm sorry..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Ah, so that god of yours is running tardy. But I'm in no mood to blame your god right now, my dear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Were we not so far from the city, a major incident like this would have the Wrankwood police locking down the plate and crawling all over our set. And naturally, the shooting would be suspended."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Not to say that our current situation is any better."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Steven, I'm starting to worry that my investment in this project will come to nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "How much do you or Greta know about what's transpired these past few days, that I don't?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff C",
        "text": "Oh, this is where you two were."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
            "loop": true,
            "channel": "bgs",
            "volume": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "soundvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.7,
            "channel": "bgs",
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff C",
        "text": "So where's the producer? Greta owes us an explanation!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Whispers abound."
    },
    {
        "text": "Gossip permeates the set, with not a single soul at work."
    },
    {
        "text": "Three homicides, and four victims. The spate of murders has everyone overcome with fear, anger, confusion, and shock... The whole film crew is on the verge of losing control."
    },
    {
        "text": "The clamor sends even her own heart into a mess. She hates the feeling."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
