        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Greta struts right into the center of the studio, and switches on the brightest bulb. The piercing light stuns everyone into silence, and everyone's attention fixes on her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She takes a deep breath."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$ponder_intro",
            "key": "$ponder_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I have some announcements to make, everyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I've never received any training as an actor, so you might have to come closer to hear me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_footsteps_flock",
            "volume": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Staff",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
            "loop": true,
            "channel": "bgs",
            "volume": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "soundvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.3,
            "channel": "bgs",
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "You'll want to check your personal Wrankwood financial terminals in a few minutes. I've instructed finance to send out everyone's remaining wages."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Of course, the families of Dalton, Shelly, Michael, and Marion will also receive compensation for their losses, which I will handle personally later."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Yes, <i>The Death of Lady Dupont</i> has yet to conclude filming, and your contracts are still valid, so none of this should even be necessary. But I can count on one hand how many of you are still in the mood to work."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Hah, this is so unlike you, Greta."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "We've simply run into a few... considerable hiccups. But this is no time to thrown in the towel."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Or has this experience made our producer lose confidence in the quality of the film?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Throwing in the towel? You're overthinking it, darling."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I've never once doubted my own judgment, much less considered abandoning the project."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Then why are you\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopsound",
        "params": {
            "channel": "bgs",
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I'd like you to gather round for a story, everyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Hey, kid..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Me, Miss Stone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Take out your pen recorder, notebook, shorthand terminal, whatever... Then sit down, and listen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Wh-What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I've seen you sneaking around with those toys, and I don't appreciate it. But feel free to record everything I'm about to say."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Take it to <i>Trimounts Entertainment Weekly</i>, or <i>Wrankwood Coffee Time</i>, or <i>Persons Magazine</i>... I don't care, as long as you get the story out. I won't hold you accountable either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "See it as a reward, or a punishment. It doesn't matter to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I take it everyone here is familiar with the Wrankwood Academy Awards."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "The Best Newcomer award. Every year, countless students of film and television schools, as well as amateur film buffs, submit their entries in a bid to prove how much they understand their creations and the market."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "They crave for their work to be chosen, because even the lowest award still implies their film is up to Wrankwood's standards... and a certain Phidia was no exception."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "She believed herself to be an auteur with both the brains and the will to realize her dreams. She was certain she would one day stand on Wrankwood's red carpet, even if she had to temporarily settle for life in a cramped rental."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "So she waited for the very best story and the very best partners, then she put together a crew and brought that story to life. Submitted it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "But this no-name newcomer craved success too much, not to mention the pressure of living up to the expectations of her companions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "As the voting period was ending, her obsession intensified, along with her doubts about the quality of the work she had submitted."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "She could not rationalize her strange thoughts. She begged both friends and family, and raised a large sum\u2014large for her then, at least\u2014before knocking on the judges' doors."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Why does this sound so familiar...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "On the very day of the Academy Awards, the committee publicized what the Phidia had done, and in so doing proved Wrankwood's professionalism and purity to the whole of Terra."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "And so she was disqualified. Her crew cut all ties with her, and she lost everything she had."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Now I remember!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "It was so ironic, because the academy later revealed that the work had actually won by votes anyway, the most recognized by the jury."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Afterward, she spent a decade exhausting every option to re-enter Wrankwood, and slowly made some achievements of her own."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Of course, she changed her name as well... to Greta Stone."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "So, Melanie. Now you know what an absolute fool I am."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I went out of my way to provoke fate into playing a joke on me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Fortunately, that preposterous experience has taught me one thing: I should never doubt myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I will always believe in my own judgment, and never give up on anything I attempt."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Haha, you're more of a character than I took you for."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Though truth be told, I always thought that infallible persona of yours was just a front to intimidate others."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "Come on, Greta."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "So what's the sudden backstory for... You trying to win our sympathy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "Dead people in here and a Catastrophe out there... You think we'd still want to put our lives on the line, just for you? After all that's happened?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I know you still hold it against me, Abner."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "...Ever since five years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "How could I? I mean, I was awarded Best Cinematography that year thanks to those classic shots from that film..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "It's the highest honor any cinematographer could ever dream of... and you gave it to me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "But what about after that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "You hit the peak of your career, then fell into despair. In just six months no one dared put you behind their cameras."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "You used to love your cameras so much, but now you treat them like empty potato chip bags."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Before you joined the crew for <i>The Death of Lady Dupont</i>, you even lost your decades-old partner at the casino, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "You hate that film from five years ago, you hate the shot that won you the award, and you hate me for making you keep it\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "You bet I do!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "My camera captured that Laura girl's fall, and when I saw how you reacted, I knew then and there that you had zero good intentions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "I warned you again and again, but you <i>insisted</i> on keeping that shot in the final cut..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "The more I think back to how the jury commented on the shot's realism and shock value, the more I want to laugh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "Film is the art of creating dreams. Cameras are the eyes that see dreams, and the hands that turn fantasy into reality. But you insulted that girl's memory. You insulted <i>me</i>!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "Now I hate this damn thing I'm holding, and I hate my work! You get it now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "If you really think so, then put it down, Abner."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I'm sorry, we've derailed. Now to get back on topic\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "After confirming you've received your compensation, any of you may leave this production at any time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Would you rather flee this dangerous plate? By all means. Scared of the serial killer, and wish to find somewhere to hide? Go ahead."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Feel like playing detective for whatever reason? Knock yourself out. Even if you're the murderer yourself, and unwilling to give up on your vengeance, you have my blessing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "We've already filmed most of <i>The Death of Lady Dupont</i>, with only a few climactic scenes to cover in the last two days of our schedule."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Who knows, maybe we can even finish it with those willing to stay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "As for who will work the camera... I will take Abner's place myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Abner",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Melanie?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "You do realize I can hardly find a last minute stand-in for Lady Dupont herself, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "You know I don't have a choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "I'm still counting on this film to beat Marianne."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Even a Catastrophe cloud can have a silver lining."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Marianne retired from cinema years ago. I've never understood why you're so obsessed with her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "That's none of your business."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "But let me be frank: you won't get to demand special treatment as the female lead or insist on those 'rules of the film set' you love so much, once everyone else has evacuated."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Haha."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Steven."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "I know, I know! I'll fix the ending by tonight!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "I believe in my decision to invest in this story, darling, and I believe you've collected enough inspiration over the past few days."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Catastrophe draws near, and death is right before our eyes... Surely your god loves material like that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steven",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "Alright, thank you for your time, people, and I wish you well on your future endeavors."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greta",
        "text": "That's all from me."
    },
    {
